test(op-conductor): unit-test handleReorgEvent

Covers the reorg handler directly (the core of the feature), reducing reliance on
the full devstack acceptance test:
- commits the EL head fetched via PayloadByHash(head.Hash()) as leader;
- non-leader observes but never reads the EL or commits;
- an InfoByLabel failure aborts before fetch/commit;
- a notification/EL tip-number mismatch still commits the EL head (reorgs can recur
  at the same height; never skip).

Uses a hand-rolled ELClient mock injected into the test conductor.

