op-devstack,op-acceptance-tests: add interop message expiry acceptance tests

Adds the DSL the message expiry tests need:
- dsl.SendETH and ETHSend.Relay, which waits until the supernode has validated
  the send;
- SentMessage, decoded from a receipt;
- L2ELNode.WaitForDeposit and L2ELNode.TraceCalls;
- a gas option for DepositEOA, and an options vararg for
  WaitForDisputeGameResolved;
- Withdrawal.DisputeGameMaxClockDuration, read from the game the withdrawal
  was proven against;
- deployer options that shorten the fault game clocks.

The supernode ETH bridge test now uses that DSL. The two message expiry tests
are skipped until the contracts they exercise land.

